  conclusionId: CONCLUSION-INCONCLUSIVE
  displayName: Inconclusive
  description: The current findings do not provide enough consistent evidence to
    identify the responsible person with confidence. Leaving the case unresolved is
    more defensible than making an unsupported accusation.
  supportingEvidenceSummary: Available once any analytical finding is confirmed (meaningful
    investigation). Availability is one-way internally, but the picker offers it
    only while no supported Case conclusion is available - once the Paul case is supported,
    Inconclusive is hidden from the picker (EndingManager.GetSelectableCaseConclusions).
